{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792447860, "covers_from": "2026-10-19T22:11:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-19T22:12:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792447920, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-19T22:11:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 56647, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北車站附近滯留遊民太多 很臭", "display_name": "中正代表 No.56,647", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T22:11:05+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34642, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "我家老宅40年，家裡長輩都70,80了，何時可以都更裝電梯換管線啊！", "display_name": "萬華代表 二寶", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T22:11:16+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44307, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "有人可以告訴我，為什麼所有議員、立委、各部會首長，沒有一個人可以阻止蔣萬安砍樹，我無言了😓", "display_name": "松山代表 No.44,307", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T22:11:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16327, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "我覺得公平樹蔭是非常進步的構想，多數人對於樹木都很重視。蔣市府為趕政績任意砍樹的作為代表其昏庸及惡性", "display_name": "信義代表 No.16,327", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T22:11:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 7138, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "我希望走在路上有更多的樹蔭。聽說「落葉」對環境生態很好。希望可以做正確的事、教育大家正確的觀念。", "display_name": "中正代表 No.7,138", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 34642, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 二寶", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 44307, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.44,307", "district": "songsha